# MathVision – Environment Configuration
# Note: MathVision runs 100% inside the user's browser.
# All features (2D Plotly graphs, 3D WebGL Three.js surfaces, Equation Solver,
# Calculus Lab, IndexedDB Projects, and the Local AI Tutor) function completely
# without any external backend or mandatory API keys.

# Optional: If you wish to pre-configure an AI provider endpoint for production deployment:
VITE_AI_PROVIDER=local-tutor
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
# VITE_CUSTOM_AI_ENDPOINT=https://your-custom-endpoint.com/api/tutor
